      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i've been having this weird feeling in my jaw and neck area for like an hour or so. it's not painful exactly, just a heavy, dull sensation. i don't have any chest pain or anything so i don't think it's anything serious but it's kinda annoying. do u think it could just be stress or maybe something with my teeth?",
