      "content": "thanks. i'll try the warm compress and some ibuprofen. i'm pretty sure it's just stress since work has been crazy lately. i'll just keep an eye on it and if it's still there tomorrow i might look into a dentist appointment. i'll probably just take some extra ibuprofen tonight to make sure it doesn't bother me while i sleep, that's fine right?",
